# {{l|en|king}}:
## a male monarch; a man who heads a monarchy. If it's an absolute monarchy, then he is the supreme ruler of his nation.
## {{lb|id|chess}} the principal chess piece, that players seek to threaten with unavoidable capture to result in a victory by checkmate. It is often the tallest piece, with a symbolic crown with a cross at the top.
## {{lb|id|card games}} a playing card with the letter "K" and the image of a king on it, the thirteenth card in a given suit.
# {{lb|id|xiangqi}} [[general]]: a [[xiangqi]] [[piece]] that is moved one point [[orthogonally]] and confined within the palace.
#: {{syn|id|jendral}} 

